## 🔌 Hooks & Custom Logic

### Persistence Hooks (`usePersistence.js`)

```javascript
usePersist(key, defaultValue)     // Generic persist hook
useTasks()                        // Task management
useVisits()                       // GPS location logging
useChatHistory()                  // Chat message history
useStats()                        // User statistics
```

### Electron Hooks (`useElectron.js`)

```javascript
useIsElectron()                   // Detect if in Electron
useElectronAPI()                  // Access electron API
useElectronStore(key, default)    // Electron data storage
useDesktopNotification()          // Native notifications
useAppInfo()                      // App version & platform
useExternalLink()                 // Safe external links
useAppLifecycle()                 // Online/offline status
```

### Custom Hooks

```javascript
useGeolocation()                  // GPS location
useOnlineStatus()                 // Network status
useAuth()                         // Azure authentication
```

