## 🚀 Getting Started

### 1. **Clone & Install**

```bash
git clone https://github.com/3w2d/nazm-app.git
cd nazm-app
npm install
```

### 2. **Configure Environment**

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
# Edit .env.local with your settings
```

### 3. **Development**

```bash
npm run dev              # Web
npm run dev:all         # Web + Electron
```

### 4. **Build**

```bash
npm run build           # Web production
npm run build:all       # All platforms
npm run dist:all        # Create installers
```

